{"schemaVersion":"1.0.0","commitSha":"c2534ff9c84422e00711da31629a76f3f59feb98","shard":"7a07e43e95ea1162","symbols":[{"path":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck","kind":"class","name":"TxInvariantCheck","qualifiedName":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck","scope":"xrpl","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"present","brief":[{"type":"text","text":"Runtime interface for a transaction-specific invariant check."}],"description":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The free checkInvariants runner drives two layers of checks over a single walk of the modified ledger entries:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[[{"type":"text","text":"Protocol checks are the concrete types in "},{"type":"link","text":"InvariantChecks","target":{"path":"xrpl/InvariantChecks","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":", held in a std::tuple and dispatched statically by a compile-time fold (no virtual calls). They are duck-typed against the two-phase contract described below; see "},{"type":"link","text":"InvariantChecker_PROTOTYPE","target":{"path":"xrpl/InvariantChecker_PROTOTYPE","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" in InvariantCheck.h."}],[{"type":"text","text":"The transaction-specific check is injected at runtime through this interface, so the runner can call it without depending on the concrete transactor type. "},{"type":"link","text":"Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" implements this interface directly (see Transactor.h) so that the interface's access can stay narrower than "},{"type":"link","text":"Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":"'s own public surface: calling through a "},{"type":"link","text":"TxInvariantCheck","target":{"path":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":"& (all the runner ever holds) is public, but calling through a "},{"type":"link","text":"Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":"& is not, since "},{"type":"link","text":"Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" overrides these as private (forwarding to its own protected visitInvariantEntry/finalizeInvariants)."}]]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both layers honour the same two-phase protocol:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 1 — state collection (visitEntry). Called once for each ledger entry created, modified, or deleted by the transaction. Implementations accumulate whatever state they need to evaluate their post-conditions. Must not throw."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Phase 2 — condition evaluation (finalize). Called once after every modified entry has been visited. Returns true if all post-conditions hold, false to fail the transaction."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rule: invariants must run regardless of transaction result. finalize MUST perform meaningful checks even when the transaction has failed (when result is not tesSUCCESS). A bug or exploit could cause a failed transaction to mutate ledger state in unexpected ways; invariants are the last line of defense."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The typical pattern: an invariant that expects a domain-specific state change (e.g. a Vault being created) should expect that change only when the transaction succeeded. A failed "},{"type":"link","text":"VaultCreate","target":{"path":"xrpl/VaultCreate","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" must not have created a Vault."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Rule: privilege-gated checks apply to failed transactions too. Failed transactions carry no privileges. Any privilege-gated assertion must therefore also be enforced for failed transactions."}]}],"returns":null,"notes":[],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/invariants/InvariantRunner.h","line":61},"definition":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/invariants/InvariantRunner.h","line":62,"endLine":98}},"corrections":[],"templateParameters":null,"isTemplateSpecialization":false,"isFinal":false,"isAbstract":true,"baseClasses":[],"derivedClasses":[{"name":"xrpl::Transactor","target":{"path":"xrpl/Transactor","resolution":"doxygen"},"access":"public","isVirtual":false}],"friends":[],"deductionGuides":[],"nested":[],"members":["xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/~TxInvariantCheck/674d14b5","xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/visitEntry/860f7b78","xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/finalize/85ac9374"],"declaration":[{"text":"class TxInvariantCheck"}]},{"path":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/~TxInvariantCheck/674d14b5","kind":"function","name":"~TxInvariantCheck","qualifiedName":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::~TxInvariantCheck","scope":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"absent","brief":null,"description":[],"returns":null,"notes":[],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/invariants/InvariantRunner.h","line":64},"definition":null},"corrections":[],"role":"destructor","overloadSet":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/~TxInvariantCheck","signatureKey":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::~TxInvariantCheck()","returnType":null,"parameters":[],"templateParameters":null,"requiresClause":null,"explicitSpecializations":[],"qualifiers":{"isStatic":false,"isConst":false,"isConstexpr":false,"isConsteval":false,"isExplicit":false,"isInline":false,"isNoexcept":false,"isNodiscard":false,"isDeleted":false,"isDefaulted":true,"isPureVirtual":false,"isOverride":false,"isFinal":false,"virtuality":"virtual","referenceQualifier":null},"declaration":[{"text":"virtual ~TxInvariantCheck() = default"}]},{"path":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/visitEntry/860f7b78","kind":"function","name":"visitEntry","qualifiedName":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::visitEntry","scope":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"present","brief":[{"type":"text","text":"Called for each ledger entry modified by the transaction."}],"description":[],"returns":null,"notes":[],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/invariants/InvariantRunner.h","line":78},"definition":null},"corrections":[],"role":"method","overloadSet":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/visitEntry","signatureKey":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::visitEntry(bool,SLE::ConstRef,SLE::ConstRef)","returnType":[{"text":"void"}],"parameters":[{"name":"isDelete","type":[{"text":"bool"}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"true if the "},{"type":"link","text":"SLE","target":{"path":"xrpl/SLE","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" is being deleted."}],"direction":null},{"name":"before","type":[{"text":"SLE::ConstRef","target":{"path":"xrpl/STLedgerEntry/ConstRef","resolution":"doxygen"}}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"the entry's state before the transaction (nullptr for newly created entries)."}],"direction":null},{"name":"after","type":[{"text":"SLE::ConstRef","target":{"path":"xrpl/STLedgerEntry/ConstRef","resolution":"doxygen"}}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"the entry's state after the transaction. For deletions this is the "},{"type":"link","text":"SLE","target":{"path":"xrpl/SLE","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" being erased; use "},{"type":"code","text":"isDelete"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than a null "},{"type":"code","text":"after"},{"type":"text","text":" to detect deletions. "},{"type":"code","text":"after"},{"type":"text","text":" is never null."}],"direction":null}],"templateParameters":null,"requiresClause":null,"explicitSpecializations":[],"qualifiers":{"isStatic":false,"isConst":false,"isConstexpr":false,"isConsteval":false,"isExplicit":false,"isInline":false,"isNoexcept":false,"isNodiscard":false,"isDeleted":false,"isDefaulted":false,"isPureVirtual":true,"isOverride":false,"isFinal":false,"virtuality":"pure-virtual","referenceQualifier":null},"declaration":[{"text":"virtual void visitEntry(bool isDelete, "},{"text":"SLE::ConstRef","target":{"path":"xrpl/STLedgerEntry/ConstRef","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" before, "},{"text":"SLE::ConstRef","target":{"path":"xrpl/STLedgerEntry/ConstRef","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" after) = 0"}]},{"path":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/finalize/85ac9374","kind":"function","name":"finalize","qualifiedName":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::finalize","scope":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck","category":"production","access":"public","documentation":{"status":"present","brief":[{"type":"text","text":"Called after all entries have been visited."}],"description":[],"returns":[{"type":"text","text":"true if all invariants hold; false to fail with tecINVARIANT_FAILED / tefINVARIANT_FAILED."}],"notes":[],"suppressionReason":null,"inheritedFrom":null},"location":{"declaration":{"file":"include/xrpl/tx/invariants/InvariantRunner.h","line":92},"definition":null},"corrections":[],"role":"method","overloadSet":"xrpl/TxInvariantCheck/finalize","signatureKey":"xrpl::TxInvariantCheck::finalize(STTx const&,TER,XRPAmount,ReadView const&,beast::Journal const&)","returnType":[{"text":"bool"}],"parameters":[{"name":"tx","type":[{"text":"STTx","target":{"path":"xrpl/STTx","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const&"}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"the transaction being applied."}],"direction":null},{"name":"result","type":[{"text":"TER","target":{"path":"xrpl/TER","resolution":"doxygen"}}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"the tentative "},{"type":"link","text":"TER","target":{"path":"xrpl/TER","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"type":"text","text":" result of the transaction."}],"direction":null},{"name":"fee","type":[{"text":"XRPAmount","target":{"path":"xrpl/XRPAmount","resolution":"doxygen"}}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"the fee consumed by the transaction."}],"direction":null},{"name":"view","type":[{"text":"ReadView","target":{"path":"xrpl/ReadView","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const&"}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"read-only view of the ledger after the transaction."}],"direction":null},{"name":"j","type":[{"text":"beast::Journal","target":{"path":"beast/Journal","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const&"}],"array":null,"defaultValue":null,"description":[{"type":"text","text":"journal for logging invariant failures."}],"direction":null}],"templateParameters":null,"requiresClause":null,"explicitSpecializations":[],"qualifiers":{"isStatic":false,"isConst":false,"isConstexpr":false,"isConsteval":false,"isExplicit":false,"isInline":false,"isNoexcept":false,"isNodiscard":true,"isDeleted":false,"isDefaulted":false,"isPureVirtual":true,"isOverride":false,"isFinal":false,"virtuality":"pure-virtual","referenceQualifier":null},"declaration":[{"text":"[[nodiscard]]\nvirtual bool finalize("},{"text":"STTx","target":{"path":"xrpl/STTx","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const& tx, "},{"text":"TER","target":{"path":"xrpl/TER","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" result, "},{"text":"XRPAmount","target":{"path":"xrpl/XRPAmount","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" fee, "},{"text":"ReadView","target":{"path":"xrpl/ReadView","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const& view, "},{"text":"beast::Journal","target":{"path":"beast/Journal","resolution":"doxygen"}},{"text":" const& j) = 0"}]}]}
